mcp-server-wazuh (1.0.0-3) unstable; urgency=low

  * Depend on python3-fastmcp (>= 4.0.10). The testing repository publishes
    4.0.10.38~trixie, so (>= 4.1.4) made the package uninstallable and the
    unit test then failed with "mcp-server-wazuh: not found".
  * Fail the Jenkins test stage when apt-get install fails.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 17:00:00 +0100

